### Success case
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/customers/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "success-{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "firstName": "Ada",
  "lastName": "Lovelace",
  "password": "Strong1!"
}

### Validation error
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/customers/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "firstName": "A",
  "lastName": "B",
  "password": "weak"
}

### Duplicate email
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/customers/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "existing@example.com",
  "firstName": "Grace",
  "lastName": "Hopper",
  "password": "Strong1!"
}
